{"type":"text","timestamp":1794238137878,"sessionID":"ses_e3f149a85ffeqkaO0YcPzh5HID","part":{"id":"prt_1c0ed3b51001JKGjmXmyIYrOMf","sessionID":"ses_e3f149a85ffeqkaO0YcPzh5HID","messageID":"msg_1c0ecf549001L0LDe3nZoUz9uZ","type":"text","text":"Implemented precise monetary calculations and rounding:\n\n- **money.py**: Added accurate Decimal-based conversions with half‑up rounding.\n- **tax.py**: Updated tax calculation to round half‑up using Decimal.\n- **invoice.py**: \n  - Renamed tax function import to avoid shadowing.\n  - Implemented per‑line discount and tax calculations with half‑up rounding.\n  - Adjusted total calculation to use discounted net and tax.\n  - Added helper for discount calculation.\n\nAll tests now pass with correct rounding and discount logic.","time":{"start":1794238135121,"end":1794238137878}}}
